    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Disrupt Qi",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "void"
      ],
      "text": "The grandmaster attempts an unarmed Strike against a living creature. On a hit, the creature takes 3d6 persistent void damage and is Enfeebled 2 until the persistent damage ends.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "roll-option",
          "option": "disrupt-qi",
          "domain": "damage",
          "toggleable": true
        },
        {
          "key": "damage-dice",
          "selector": "strike-damage",
          "dice": 3,
          "die": "d6",
          "type": "void",
          "category": "persistent",
          "when": [
            "disrupt-qi",
            "item:category:unarmed",
            "target:mode:living"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Flurry of Blows",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect The grandmaster makes two fist Strikes. If both hit the same creature, combine their damage for the purpose of resistances and weaknesses.\n\nThe grandmaster can substitute any number of the attacks with temple sword Strikes or attempts to grapple, reposition, shove, or trip.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Forbidden Palm",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The grandmaster has at least 1 Focus Point\n\n---\nEffect The grandmaster casts Touch of Death (spending 1 Focus Point as normal). Any time the target attempts a Fortitude save against this touch of death, the grandmaster takes 40 damage and is permanently Enfeebled 1. If the target gets a critical success, it's Stunned 1; if it gets a success or failure the stunned condition it gains is increased by 1, and any damage it takes is increased by 40."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "One-Millimeter Punch",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "2 or 3\n\n---\nThe grandmaster makes a single, carefully controlled unarmed Strike that deals 2 additional dice of damage, or 4 additional dice if the grandmaster spent 3 actions. If this damages the target, the grandmaster can choose to make the target attempt a DC 38 Fortitude save save.\n\n---\nCritical Success The target is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The target is pushed back 5 feet.\n\nFailure The target is pushed back 10 feet.\n\nCritical Failure The target is pushed back 10 feet for each action the grandmaster spent on One-Millimeter Punch.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "unsupported",
          "foundry": {
            "domain": "damage",
            "key": "RollOption",
            "option": "one-millimeter-punch",
            "suboptions": [
              {
                "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Actions.TwoActions",
                "value": "2"
              },
              {
                "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Actions.ThreeActions",
                "value": "4"
              }
            ],
            "toggleable": true
          }
        },
        {
